  "detail_text": "Amendment 3: Updated Attachment 1 and added Attachment 3 \"AFWERX Prime ICO Call 0002 - Electrification of Fixed Wing Aircraft - 19 Mar 2026\" Amendment 2: Updated Attachment 1 and Attachment 2. Clarfied Effective Close date of Call 0001 from \"1 August 2024\" to \"1 August 2024 11:59PM EST\" Amendment 1: Updated Attachment 2. AFWERX Prime ICO Call 0001 - Prime AuP AG Flyoff Final - 20240206. Corrected typo within Section 4. Corrected to \"Astronomical\". Please see the following attachments for relevant information in submitting against this ICO. 1. AFWERX Prime ICO Final 2. AFWERX Prime ICO Call 0001 - Prime AuP AG Flyoff Final - 20240131 Overarching ICO information can be found in Attachment 1 (AFWERX Prime ICO Final). Subsequent attachments will contain information regarding current and future Calls. All submission information, requirements, and specifications will be listed within those attachments until updated or otherwise changed. Please reach out to prime.ico@afwerx.af.mil with any questions, concerns, or difficulties with this posting.",
